WEBVTT

00:12.960 --> 00:14.660
<i>Bridge to all hands!</i>

00:14.660 --> 00:17.660
<i>We've lost control of the helm! 
Cause unknown!</i>

00:22.350 --> 00:23.750
<i>We're off course!</i>

00:28.470 --> 00:30.880
<i>At this rate, we'll ram into Hopeland!</i>

00:32.750 --> 00:33.710
Oh, no...

00:34.890 --> 00:36.800
That's where the orphanage is!

00:55.700 --> 00:59.240
<i>My tears scattered like bits of paper</i>

00:59.240 --> 01:02.950
<i>Scared of the unknowable tomorrow</i>

01:02.950 --> 01:06.470
<i>I lived the same day over and over,
 back and forth</i>

01:06.470 --> 01:10.300
<i>But a new morning never came</i>

01:10.300 --> 01:12.550
<i>All the reasons to calm down</i>

01:12.550 --> 01:16.980
<i>Are just some moments until the crash</i>

01:17.500 --> 01:20.480
<i>I'm no longer the one that everyone knows</i>

01:20.480 --> 01:24.780
<i>Took off the fragile armor</i>

01:24.780 --> 01:31.850
<i>I don't want to lose any more love</i>

01:32.270 --> 01:39.330
<i>I don't want to lose any more love</i>

01:39.330 --> 01:43.020
<i>There's still no line 
between today and tomorrow</i>

01:43.020 --> 01:46.590
<i>My waking nightmare doesn't end</i>

01:46.590 --> 01:50.220
<i>And yet I won't lose hope</i>

01:50.220 --> 01:56.270
<i>And yet there's no night that doesn't end</i>

01:56.270 --> 02:08.610
<i>Not here, not here</i>

02:14.230 --> 02:15.830
Find the goods!

02:15.830 --> 02:17.500
We're taking this ship, gang!

02:17.900 --> 02:20.130
Damn it! We're busy here!

02:26.400 --> 02:28.870
Crap! Run! Get back!

02:28.870 --> 02:30.120
What's with this guy?!

02:30.540 --> 02:33.080
Don't hesitate! Push on!

02:33.580 --> 02:35.800
It's open! We're taking over!

02:35.800 --> 02:39.230
Damn, how many of these goons are there?

02:47.560 --> 02:51.090
Move it, Needle-noggin! 
If you stay here, we'll just die together!

02:51.090 --> 02:52.970
Grab anything that glitters!

02:52.970 --> 02:54.320
Get going already!

02:54.320 --> 02:56.350
Report to the boss!

02:56.350 --> 02:57.480
I'll be right back!

02:57.480 --> 03:01.600
That idiot just won't listen!

03:01.600 --> 03:02.660
And neither do you!

03:14.110 --> 03:15.340
You're staying here!

03:33.920 --> 03:35.750
This is my responsibility.

03:35.750 --> 03:40.650
So I'll handle it... I'll kill you myself.

03:44.450 --> 03:45.520
Let's go!

03:45.520 --> 03:47.490
Come on! Take a good one!

03:47.490 --> 03:51.500
O-Of course... Well, here we go!

03:51.660 --> 03:52.660
Okay!

03:52.830 --> 03:53.920
Nice!

03:54.080 --> 03:55.420
Good!

03:55.420 --> 03:58.230
I can't believe we're gonna be on
 the cover of an outlaw magazine!

03:58.230 --> 04:00.220
Man, we've come so far!

04:00.220 --> 04:03.230
Hey, you'd better not use any bad pictures!

04:03.230 --> 04:06.100
I'll gut you and feed 
your innards to the Worms!

04:06.100 --> 04:08.810
Don't scare the kid, you idiot!

04:08.810 --> 04:11.220
That was just a joke, okay, little lady?

04:11.220 --> 04:13.100
Hey, laugh more.

04:14.330 --> 04:17.950
Yeah, that's the spirit!
Gotta keep smiling in life, right?

04:19.100 --> 04:20.780
Roberto...

04:20.780 --> 04:22.470
I don't even know.

04:27.650 --> 04:29.290
Who are you?!

04:30.650 --> 04:31.670
Vash?!

04:32.000 --> 04:33.620
What are you guys doing here?

04:33.620 --> 04:36.030
Er, gee, I wonder...

04:36.920 --> 04:38.510
Where's the undertaker?

04:38.510 --> 04:39.690
He's...

04:41.050 --> 04:42.220
More of them!

04:42.220 --> 04:43.240
Stand back.

04:44.470 --> 04:47.600
Sorry. I'm in a hurry.

05:05.200 --> 05:06.320
Monsters...

05:06.320 --> 05:07.220
H-H-Hey!

05:07.220 --> 05:09.370
Run! They'll kill us all!

05:13.300 --> 05:16.770
Who is Vash, really?

05:16.770 --> 05:20.420
Not human, that's for sure.

05:28.760 --> 05:29.960
Catch up...

05:31.750 --> 05:33.810
I have to catch up.

05:34.980 --> 05:37.310
I have to catch up.

05:37.310 --> 05:40.810
I have to be like Nico one day...

05:42.210 --> 05:45.570
I have to catch up to him...

05:46.060 --> 05:50.820
Livio, you were always following me around.

05:51.340 --> 05:52.740
You're such a pain.

05:52.740 --> 05:56.500
You... need to stop chasing after me.

06:00.290 --> 06:04.130
You... Things would've been
better off without you around.

06:10.860 --> 06:12.550
Wait for me in hell.

06:17.310 --> 06:18.510
Needle-noggin?!

06:19.670 --> 06:22.130
Aww, it got shot.

06:22.760 --> 06:25.050
Hurry up and prepare the next eye.

06:25.050 --> 06:27.150
Ooh, so scary.

06:40.670 --> 06:42.550
Why'd you come back?!

06:42.550 --> 06:43.980
He's important to you, right?

06:45.460 --> 06:46.690
I'll help.

06:46.690 --> 06:48.610
What? Enough already!

06:49.010 --> 06:51.010
If I could do it, I would have by now!

06:53.170 --> 06:55.100
Bring back his real self!

06:57.450 --> 07:00.560
There has to be <i>something</i> he'd never forget!

07:02.230 --> 07:03.250
Needle-noggin!

07:06.860 --> 07:08.900
That blabbermouth...

07:08.900 --> 07:10.640
Who's behind this?

07:46.480 --> 07:48.800
Something he'd never forget. Right.

07:57.490 --> 07:58.740
Undertaker?

07:58.740 --> 08:00.350
This ends...

08:02.490 --> 08:03.870
right now.

08:06.900 --> 08:08.460
Wake up already.

08:08.460 --> 08:10.620
You've always been like this.

08:10.620 --> 08:13.810
Whenever something bad happens, 
you hide under the blankets.

08:24.500 --> 08:25.520
Livio.

08:31.110 --> 08:32.740
Nico...

08:34.410 --> 08:35.520
Livio?

08:43.480 --> 08:46.670
<i>Remember this. Remember who you are.</i>

08:46.670 --> 08:49.010
<i>Kill all who stand in our way.</i>

08:49.010 --> 08:53.930
<i>Based on absolute veneration, 
fueled by complete self-sacrifice...</i>

08:53.930 --> 08:56.010
<i>The perfect executor.</i>

08:56.010 --> 09:00.560
<i>We are the Eye of Michael.</i>

09:11.320 --> 09:12.320
Livio!

09:16.820 --> 09:17.900
Livio!

09:25.880 --> 09:27.600
Stop this ship already!

09:29.040 --> 09:30.720
It's no use! The rudder won't respond!

09:30.720 --> 09:31.870
Damn it! What's going on?!

09:31.870 --> 09:34.390
This is bad. If we don't do something...

09:34.390 --> 09:37.810
we'll ram straight into Hopeland!

09:37.810 --> 09:39.970
We'll take out the whole town!

09:40.500 --> 09:43.380
Something's wrong with the ship.

09:43.380 --> 09:45.180
What's going on?

09:45.180 --> 09:46.940
Who did this?!

09:49.060 --> 09:50.480
Is this what you wanted?

09:50.480 --> 09:52.770
Lack of faith is the real problem.

09:53.730 --> 09:55.580
There's no need for emotion.

09:56.090 --> 10:01.110
Without his little brother, without the 
orphanage, he can be the perfect believer.

10:01.110 --> 10:03.740
So that's why you sent the brother in.

10:03.740 --> 10:08.790
I just want to spread
 the good word. That's all.

10:09.690 --> 10:12.630
Why is that so hard?

10:12.630 --> 10:13.990
I think it's a misunderstanding.

10:15.380 --> 10:19.760
I've had enough. I'll take out 
the orphanage by force.

10:20.640 --> 10:25.800
With his brother and the orphanage gone, 
I'm sure he'll change his mind.

10:29.920 --> 10:33.560
This is <i>my</i> version of love...

10:37.030 --> 10:39.120
Punisher.

10:41.570 --> 10:45.640
<i>What's going on?! The upper deck is moving!</i>

10:45.640 --> 10:47.040
<i>We don't know!</i>

10:47.580 --> 10:50.110
That's... an ion cannon.

10:50.110 --> 10:51.210
Ion cannon?!

10:51.210 --> 10:53.530
C'mon, you gotta be kidding me.

10:53.530 --> 10:56.960
Not only is the ship going berserk, 
there's also a huge cannon?

10:57.550 --> 11:00.360
Welp, I say it's time to throw in the towel.

11:00.360 --> 11:01.710
Roberto!

11:03.250 --> 11:06.310
I don't know who orchestrated this,
 but we're done.

11:07.440 --> 11:08.850
That car...

11:08.850 --> 11:11.440
What are they doing here?

11:11.440 --> 11:12.810
Hi!

11:15.700 --> 11:18.390
We're stopping both the
 ion cannon and the ship.

11:18.390 --> 11:20.010
Seriously?

11:20.010 --> 11:21.160
Do you know how?

11:21.160 --> 11:22.960
Of course I frickin' don't!

11:22.960 --> 11:23.590
Huh?

11:23.590 --> 11:25.490
But we'll make it happen with guts and grit!

11:25.490 --> 11:27.380
Huh? That's nonsense.

11:27.380 --> 11:28.570
Follow me!

11:29.890 --> 11:31.310
H-Hang on!

11:32.350 --> 11:34.090
Why does this ship even
 have an ion cannon?

11:34.090 --> 11:36.730
It was originally for destroying obstacles.

11:36.730 --> 11:39.580
The ship uses parts from the Spacefaring Age.

11:40.260 --> 11:42.350
And this is...

11:47.810 --> 11:49.420
The control room?

11:49.420 --> 11:52.640
Well, damn, it's actually a spaceship.

11:52.640 --> 11:54.560
I've never seen machines like this before.

11:57.310 --> 11:59.550
Please work...

12:07.180 --> 12:08.200
You did it!

12:08.200 --> 12:09.730
No, not yet.

12:13.950 --> 12:16.490
It's not working... I can't move the shaft.

12:16.490 --> 12:18.420
So you can't stop it?

12:18.420 --> 12:22.630
The only way now is to turn 
the ship or the cannon manually.

12:22.630 --> 12:25.610
What? This huge thing?

12:26.320 --> 12:29.100
You can't be serious. That's—

12:29.100 --> 12:31.710
Fine. I'll do it.

12:32.280 --> 12:33.770
It's the only way, right?!

12:35.600 --> 12:38.160
Just be careful with the plant, okay?

12:38.160 --> 12:42.320
But of course. We'll bring it home 
without so much as a scratch.

12:46.770 --> 12:47.650
There's no time.

12:47.650 --> 12:48.700
That's obvious!

12:48.700 --> 12:49.810
Take care of the cannon!

12:49.810 --> 12:51.150
Ugh, damn it!

13:38.500 --> 13:39.910
Okay.

13:42.410 --> 13:44.420
Hey! Watch what you're doing!

14:09.360 --> 14:14.450
<i>Main cannon energy charging. 
Forty percent charged and rising.</i>

14:14.940 --> 14:18.460
Once we move the cannon, 
I want you to activate the trigger mechanism!

14:18.460 --> 14:20.820
<i>Initiating firing sequence shortly.</i>

14:20.820 --> 14:22.410
Let's go, newbie.

14:22.980 --> 14:26.220
I found a lifeboat. We can still make it.

14:26.220 --> 14:28.590
What? What are you talking about?

14:28.590 --> 14:32.350
We're not risking our lives. 
That was our deal.

14:33.450 --> 14:39.440
What's your job? It's to survive 
and write an article about this.

14:39.440 --> 14:43.020
Stop trying to be a hero. 
We're both just normal people.

14:43.020 --> 14:46.590
You don't believe they can move the cannon?

14:46.590 --> 14:49.730
Or stop the ship. Now let's go.

14:52.530 --> 14:54.700
Time to get out of here!

15:09.470 --> 15:11.160
Damn it all to hell...

15:22.480 --> 15:24.620
There's no way!

15:25.630 --> 15:28.510
Any idiot would know this is impossible.

15:28.510 --> 15:29.990
Buy us some time!

15:29.990 --> 15:32.990
Come on, newbie, that's an order!

15:32.990 --> 15:35.340
<i>Sixty percent charged and rising.</i>

15:35.340 --> 15:38.650
I'm sorry, Roberto. 
Please go on without me.

15:38.650 --> 15:39.960
I'm staying put.

15:39.960 --> 15:42.440
You fool! You'll die here!

15:42.440 --> 15:44.080
I know this is stupid!

15:44.710 --> 15:47.520
So I won't blame anyone for running away.

15:48.050 --> 15:51.800
But me? I'm sick of it!

15:53.570 --> 15:57.700
I regret what happened in Jeneora Rock.

15:58.950 --> 16:01.370
If only I had held on to Tonis,

16:02.270 --> 16:04.240
he wouldn't have lost his arm.

16:05.150 --> 16:07.260
I've regretted it all this time.

16:08.570 --> 16:13.500
And if I run away now, 
I'll feel the same way.

16:14.490 --> 16:15.600
So...

16:17.110 --> 16:19.120
I'm staying right here!

16:20.410 --> 16:22.540
<i>Eighty percent charged.</i>

16:32.340 --> 16:34.880
I'm sorry, Wolfwood.

16:34.880 --> 16:36.620
What're you going on about now?

16:40.460 --> 16:45.180
There <i>was</i> something you wanted 
to protect more than anything else.

16:45.180 --> 16:48.610
Enough already! This isn't the time!

16:48.610 --> 16:52.610
<i>Main cannon firing sequence 
90 percent complete.</i>

16:52.610 --> 16:56.830
<i>Ninety-one. Ninety-two.</i>

16:55.610 --> 17:02.620
Save it for after everything works out!

16:56.830 --> 17:00.230
<i>Ninety-three. Ninety-four.</i>

17:03.060 --> 17:06.340
<i>Ninety-six. Ninety-seven.</i>

17:07.170 --> 17:10.220
<i>Ninety-eight. Ninety-nine.</i>

17:11.100 --> 17:13.590
<i>One hundred percent.
 Plant output at maximum.</i>

17:13.590 --> 17:14.720
Now!

17:15.860 --> 17:16.680
Right!

17:50.380 --> 17:53.000
No time to rest.

17:53.000 --> 17:55.350
I'll stop this ship 
by making it self-destruct.

17:55.350 --> 17:57.330
What about the people on board?

17:58.180 --> 18:00.840
This isn't the time for that!

18:00.840 --> 18:02.720
I'll save both the town and the ship!

18:02.720 --> 18:06.600
If you can't kill anyone, 
you can't save anyone!

18:06.600 --> 18:07.770
There's a way!

18:10.940 --> 18:14.310
Have it your way. Just for today!

18:14.310 --> 18:16.440
I <i>do</i> owe you one.

18:16.440 --> 18:19.980
But if the orphanage doesn't survive this,

18:19.980 --> 18:24.830
I'll hurt you so bad you'll wish 
you were dead before I kill you.

18:25.710 --> 18:26.790
Wolfwood...

18:26.790 --> 18:29.580
Shut up! I'm the Punisher.

18:31.100 --> 18:32.840
I'm not like you.

18:35.050 --> 18:37.420
I'm Nicholas the Punisher.

18:44.260 --> 18:45.520
Huh?

18:45.520 --> 18:50.170
<i>Warning. Settlement ahead. 
Emergency evasion advised.</i>

18:51.770 --> 18:53.770
Wh-What should I do?!

18:53.770 --> 18:56.280
<i>Repeat: Settlement ahead.</i>

18:56.280 --> 18:57.250
You go to the engine room!

18:57.250 --> 18:58.040
What about you?!

18:58.040 --> 18:59.300
Take care of the engine room!

19:26.550 --> 19:28.350
I'm so sorry for this.

19:35.030 --> 19:37.150
I need your help.

19:44.760 --> 19:48.910
<i>Warning. Approaching settlement. 
Please take evasive action.</i>

19:51.150 --> 19:52.130
Who are you?!

19:52.130 --> 19:53.220
Out of the way!

19:56.060 --> 19:59.030
<i>Repeat: Please take evasive action.</i>

20:06.030 --> 20:09.180
Stop already!

20:54.060 --> 20:56.280
W-We stopped...

21:05.910 --> 21:07.370
A sandstorm?

21:09.620 --> 21:11.210
Is that your doing?

21:11.210 --> 21:14.420
Of course not. Can I go home now?

21:14.420 --> 21:17.130
Not yet. Go pick up Double Fang.

21:19.970 --> 21:21.660
He's still of use.

21:30.350 --> 21:31.820
Vash?!

21:32.610 --> 21:35.040
Where'd Needle-noggin go?

21:35.040 --> 21:38.180
The only place we haven't 
checked is the plant room.

21:39.440 --> 21:40.820
Vash!

22:08.090 --> 22:09.650
Vash...

22:12.680 --> 22:14.320
That pattern...

22:16.460 --> 22:18.060
A plant...?

22:20.060 --> 22:27.680
<i>Your light...</i>

22:34.140 --> 22:38.440
<i>If that light never changes</i>

22:38.440 --> 22:42.870
<i>And continues to shine high above the sky</i>

22:42.870 --> 22:47.180
<i>Even when I'm lost, 
even when I'm struggling</i>

22:47.180 --> 22:51.430
<i>I'll continue to search for you</i>

22:51.430 --> 22:55.720
<i>Even on days of sickness or sadness</i>

22:55.720 --> 23:00.100
<i>I'll open the window to a new morning</i>

23:00.100 --> 23:04.290
<i>I'm moving forward, I'm standing still</i>

23:04.290 --> 23:07.850
<i>Tell the people who are praying</i>

23:07.850 --> 23:13.810
<i>But today this flower 
before me is praising you</i>

23:13.810 --> 23:16.820
<i>My song is a song of joy and wishes</i>

23:16.820 --> 23:19.540
<i>Yes, I'm reaching out</i>

23:19.540 --> 23:24.880
<i>But you're too high up 
in the evening stars</i>

23:24.880 --> 23:30.850
<i>But today this flower 
before me is praising you</i>

23:30.850 --> 23:34.000
<i>My song is a song of joy and wishes</i>

23:34.000 --> 23:36.700
<i>Yes, I try to reach out</i>

23:36.700 --> 23:41.860
<i>But you're too high up 
in the evening stars</i>
